                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a44abf4-9d3d-4b19-ab49-666a61069dff",
                                                "sense_id": "8142bc8e-f4da-3417-8095-45315cb3509a",
                                                "text": "Although an Arab country — which may be sufficient guilt for people like Thomas Friedman who see a singular \"Arab Street\" — its character as a secular state should have further distanced it, in the minds of other Muslimphobe American […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13428409-91f1-422b-aa65-0bf923591ffa",
                                                "sense_id": "8142bc8e-f4da-3417-8095-45315cb3509a",
                                                "text": "The Bloomfield Buddy wrote: I'm also a Muslimphobe, I can go you one better: I'm a faithophobe"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5e0f67e-f260-4a4b-ac05-e042a81482ed",
                                                "sense_id": "8142bc8e-f4da-3417-8095-45315cb3509a",
                                                "text": "If the Yids do not allow muslims in their army they therefore must be muslimphobes."
